  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "What you see",
      "items": [
        "Each trigger's History: Waiting, Sent to Lettuce, the task, an error or Lost",
        "The runs in Lettuce's Tasks tab as \"Gmail: <trigger name>\"",
        "A matching email reaches the agent within about five minutes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "What it does not stop",
      "items": [
        "The agent reads the email, so a hostile email can still try to steer it",
        "\"Act only on these emails\" is guidance in the prompt, not a boundary",
        "Agents can see what the executor sees, but can't create requests"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Never twice",
      "items": [
        "A request is never handed out twice: a lost turn beats a duplicate",
        "Your own sent mail, Spam and Trash never set off a trigger"
      ]
    }
  ]
